silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '08KgcrossreferenceYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 08_kg_cross_reference, the ]\\\\ |[constraintnode]| NodeOrArrowLaw [r, arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens.; also, In the Music graph engine entry section 08_kg_cross_reference, the music_typed_leg_5 arrow witnesses the DomesticCat classification arrow as a typed source leg into D_Mittens — NOT an identity onto Mittens." .
